Source: https://github.com/mitnits/tmeld
Comment: tmeld vendors parts of GNOME Meld's engine byte-for-byte apart
 from mechanical import rewrites; see tmeld/_vendor/UPSTREAM for the
 pinned upstream commit. The binary package additionally bundles
 Textual and its dependencies (MIT-licensed), fetched at build time.

